                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} T(V)
                is the tensor algebra (the free
                = succeed "-algebra" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
