                %a{:href => "http://www.tac.mta.ca/tac/volumes/24/14/24-14abs.html"}> tac:24-14
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            The relation to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/linear+logic"} linear logic
            was first described in
          %ul
            %li#Seely89
